WEBVTT

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.450
The inspection procedure changed.

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.290
Who's trained on the new one?

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.920
With ICC Training and Competence, you can
assign the updated training to the

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.990
inspection team and give everyone a due
date.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:16.540
Open the campaign to see who's finished,
who's still working on it, and

00:00:16.540 --> 00:00:21.860
who's overdue. That gives the shift lead a
clear list of people to follow up

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:26.500
with. When someone passes the assessment,
their completion is recorded, and

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.930
they get a certificate.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.610
If an auditor asks for proof, you can pull
up the record.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:38.360
Book a training and competence demo with
ISO Certification Consultants.
